      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat: use local aig skill scanner",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- replace the old API-backed A.I.G adapter with Tencent's local `aig-skill-scan` CLI\n- preserve SARIF 2.1.0 output, normalized AIG verdicts, and SkillTrustBench T01-T09 evidence\n- update installer metadata, sandbox runtime wiring, benchmark handling, docs, help, and tests\n\n## Scope\n\n- [x] CLI behavior\n- [x] Scanner adapter\n- [x] Judge/profile/benchmark behavior\n- [ ] ClawHub profile proposal at `proposals/<GHSA-ID>/clawscan.yml`\n- [ ] Docs only\n- [x] Release/CI/repo automation\n\n## Security / Trust Impact\n\n- [x] Security/trust impact explained\n\nAIG now runs locally through `aig-skill-scan --repo <target> --language en -o <result.sarif.json>` instead of uploading skill content to the legacy A.I.G service. ClawScan validates and preserves the upstream SARIF evidence in its artifact and keeps command execution within the existing sandbox-by-default boundary.\n\n## Verification\n\n- [x] `go test -count=1 ./...`\n- [x] `go vet ./...`\n- [x] `go run ./cmd/clawscan --help`\n- [x] `go run ./cmd/clawscan scanners aig`\n- [x] `node --test npm/clawscan/test/*.test.mjs`\n- [x] `node --test scripts/build-npm-package.test.mjs`\n- [x] `node scripts/build-npm-package.mjs --version v0.1.2 --pack --smoke`\n- [x] `make docs-site`\n- [x] `actionlint`\n- [x] `docker build -f docker/clawscan-runtime/Dockerfile -t clawscan-runtime:aig-local .`\n- [x] `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode branch --base origin/main`\n\n## Notes\n\nNo live LLM credential was used. Release publication is intentionally performed after this PR merges.\n",
